{"explanation":"Let regular users see the approved archive when they do not have a Researcher profile, instead of returning an empty dashboard list.","replacements":[{"filePath":"c:\Users\nirva\comp3613a1\app\repositories\publication.py","oldString":"    def list_for_researcher(self, user_id: int) -> list[Publication]:
